WEBVTT

01:13.490 --> 01:14.532
This is safe.

01:26.795 --> 01:27.796
Go on.

01:28.797 --> 01:30.924
Sir, will you be okay on your own?

04:59.966 --> 05:01.801
How does it feel to be a killer?

05:04.595 --> 05:05.513
Shh.

05:25.074 --> 05:26.367
And you will…

05:27.410 --> 05:28.703
never ever…

05:29.620 --> 05:30.747
be able…

05:31.289 --> 05:33.291
…to forget me.

06:56.082 --> 06:57.792
Do I need to go now
for questioning?

07:02.713 --> 07:03.714
Wanna drink?

07:16.310 --> 07:17.687
First snowfall of the year.

07:21.649 --> 07:23.234
Can I come in?

07:24.694 --> 07:25.903
Have you eaten anything?

07:31.325 --> 07:32.577
Do you even eat?

07:48.009 --> 07:49.385
Jeez.

07:49.469 --> 07:51.387
The decor is very you.

07:55.892 --> 07:57.977
Tonight's not good.

08:03.733 --> 08:05.067
So stuffy in here.

08:09.113 --> 08:11.199
You shouldn't be alone
on a day like today.

08:24.086 --> 08:25.379
Do you like the snow?

08:30.384 --> 08:32.803
You always avoid answering.

08:34.764 --> 08:36.474
What things do you like?

08:36.557 --> 08:38.768
Don't you have any hobbies?

08:40.686 --> 08:43.231
Now your fridge tells me
cooking is not one of them.

08:46.901 --> 08:47.985
No, I don't.

08:50.363 --> 08:52.323
Well, then what fun is life?

08:54.200 --> 08:56.035
Is life supposed to be fun?

09:01.916 --> 09:03.709
You're so frustrating.

09:03.793 --> 09:06.170
No hobbies? You should make some.

09:06.254 --> 09:09.131
People in our line of work
need to take a break.

09:09.215 --> 09:11.217
Relax and not think sometimes.

09:15.555 --> 09:17.098
Beaches are nice.

09:19.517 --> 09:20.560
I like being there.

09:21.644 --> 09:22.645
Oh.

09:25.314 --> 09:26.274
Well…

09:26.983 --> 09:30.361
It would be beautiful to look
at the ocean on a day like this.

09:32.905 --> 09:34.323
Should we go now?

09:35.283 --> 09:37.159
You'll lose your license if we go now.

09:39.870 --> 09:42.123
We'll go another day, all right?

09:43.457 --> 09:45.042
I'm a really good fisherman.

09:45.126 --> 09:47.545
You'll never want restaurant sushi again.

09:47.628 --> 09:48.838
I swear it.

09:53.175 --> 09:54.885
There's no need to try so hard.

10:01.100 --> 10:02.184
I'm fine.

10:15.031 --> 10:16.282
No, you're not.

10:19.201 --> 10:20.494
You and Do Gangjae…

10:22.121 --> 10:23.623
you knew each other, right?

10:25.207 --> 10:28.419
I heard him at the junkyard
before I passed out.

10:29.837 --> 10:31.213
The way he said your name.

10:45.186 --> 10:47.229
He tried to rape me a long time ago.

10:49.315 --> 10:50.733
He drugged me first.

10:58.991 --> 11:00.493
I got this scar…

11:02.953 --> 11:05.373
when I tried to wake myself up
from the drug.

11:13.464 --> 11:15.091
So it was Do Gangjae.

11:18.219 --> 11:19.887
The one you wanted to catch.

13:30.601 --> 13:34.438
I thought I wouldn't see you again
until after we die, but here we are.

13:37.566 --> 13:40.277
You still living your life
fighting all the time?

13:41.779 --> 13:43.364
No choice in the matter

13:44.907 --> 13:46.450
if I want to survive.

13:49.662 --> 13:51.330
Life is a battle.

13:54.667 --> 13:56.961
You can't lose
and you can't give in.

13:57.044 --> 13:58.754
That's why it's a war.

14:03.384 --> 14:05.386
How else am I supposed to live?

14:08.097 --> 14:09.849
Are there people you can trust?

14:15.354 --> 14:16.438
That's good then.

14:17.356 --> 14:18.858
Rest here for a few days.

14:36.458 --> 14:37.501
Attention.

14:41.130 --> 14:44.091
These are the possible routes
Choi Mujin could've taken.

14:45.843 --> 14:48.137
Find out if anyone
within a two-mile radius

14:48.220 --> 14:50.222
is associated with Dongcheon.

14:50.306 --> 14:52.057
He had to have gotten treated.

14:52.141 --> 14:53.851
Check with every hospital, every vet,

14:53.934 --> 14:56.103
and retired doctor in the area.
Understood?

14:56.186 --> 14:57.354
Yes, sir.

15:02.443 --> 15:03.402
Choi Mujin!

15:13.871 --> 15:15.497
Hey. It's me.

15:15.581 --> 15:18.208
Can I get all the documents
on that car with the fake plate?

15:19.001 --> 15:21.086
Call me when they're ready.
I'll pick 'em up.

15:21.921 --> 15:22.838
Okay.

15:43.442 --> 15:47.446
JIWOO

16:29.071 --> 16:31.699
SONG JOONSU

16:32.408 --> 16:34.034
Song Joonsu…

16:34.576 --> 16:35.786
Who is Song Joonsu?

16:35.869 --> 16:38.372
He died shortly after joining Narcotics.

16:40.666 --> 16:42.876
You don't know anything.

16:43.544 --> 16:46.630
SENDER
DO GANGJAE

16:52.219 --> 16:53.220
Jiwoo.

16:53.929 --> 16:55.597
I'm going to stay here tonight.

16:55.681 --> 16:56.932
Meet me here.

16:59.435 --> 17:02.354
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME…

17:26.336 --> 17:27.296
What's up here?

17:27.379 --> 17:30.049
It's a factory
that processes forest products.

17:36.764 --> 17:38.015
And over there?

17:38.098 --> 17:40.726
There is a small temple
on Cheonwang Mountain.

17:47.566 --> 17:48.734
It's ready.

18:25.270 --> 18:26.396
Sit down.

18:32.111 --> 18:33.445
How are you feeling?

18:36.031 --> 18:37.199
It hurts.

18:38.951 --> 18:40.494
I haven't been stabbed in a while.

18:40.577 --> 18:41.453
It hurts.

18:43.497 --> 18:44.873
I had forgotten…

18:47.167 --> 18:48.836
…just how much it hurts.

18:53.423 --> 18:55.592
Do Gangjae sent me a photo.

19:01.223 --> 19:04.560
The Song Joonsu
that they said died 17 years ago…

19:09.106 --> 19:10.941
My father was a cop?

19:21.618 --> 19:22.619
Yes.

19:24.413 --> 19:25.914
Donghoon was a cop.

19:28.125 --> 19:29.418
Cha Giho had sent him.

19:30.544 --> 19:32.462
He wanted to take us down from inside.

19:35.048 --> 19:36.717
But Donghoon flipped on him.

19:37.551 --> 19:38.844
Came to our side.

19:41.346 --> 19:42.806
Like I told you before…

19:45.100 --> 19:46.935
Your father saved my life.

19:55.652 --> 19:56.778
Let's go in.

20:41.865 --> 20:43.158
YOON DONGHOON

20:43.242 --> 20:45.285
I didn't even know my dad's name.

20:48.038 --> 20:49.122
Two lives.

20:52.376 --> 20:53.752
Two names.

20:57.631 --> 21:00.717
So that's why he looked like
he was on the edge of a cliff.

21:06.640 --> 21:08.350
That's how you look now.

21:12.020 --> 21:13.730
Do you feel on the edge?

21:16.650 --> 21:18.277
Whenever he had time,

21:19.069 --> 21:21.071
he'd disappear somewhere by himself.

21:22.990 --> 21:24.741
I assumed it was a girl.

21:28.787 --> 21:29.788
One day,

21:30.580 --> 21:32.666
I happened to see him out on the street.

21:33.875 --> 21:35.294
I followed him.

21:36.712 --> 21:39.339
I was worried he was seeing someone shady.

21:43.427 --> 21:45.971
But I just turned around and I left.

21:49.224 --> 21:51.560
If she can make him smile like that,

21:52.561 --> 21:54.604
it didn't matter who she was.

21:57.149 --> 21:58.525
I found out later…

22:01.069 --> 22:02.321
that it was you.

22:08.076 --> 22:09.745
Your dad is Yoon Donghoon.

22:11.163 --> 22:13.540
He lived and died with the organization.

22:15.625 --> 22:16.626
Jiwoo.

22:17.210 --> 22:18.462
Don't get weak.

22:20.255 --> 22:22.341
And don't ever forget how you got here.

22:25.552 --> 22:27.262
Why did you hide it from me?

22:30.766 --> 22:32.517
Because you need conviction

22:33.560 --> 22:34.936
to be a killer.

22:38.065 --> 22:40.525
I wanted you to find the answer yourself.

23:05.300 --> 23:06.385
Jiwoo.

23:09.137 --> 23:11.014
What more is there to confirm?

23:13.558 --> 23:14.559
Or…

23:16.686 --> 23:18.438
are you hesitating?

23:32.494 --> 23:33.495
Can you tell me…

23:34.287 --> 23:35.664
Have you seen this man?

23:36.873 --> 23:39.626
No one has visited us for a while.

23:48.718 --> 23:52.013
People don't come to temples much
when the weather gets cold.

23:58.019 --> 23:58.979
Hello?

24:03.775 --> 24:04.860
Where are you?

24:26.423 --> 24:28.133
Was Dongcheon involved?

24:28.216 --> 24:30.051
Dongcheon killed him.

24:30.635 --> 24:32.929
Cha Giho couldn't accept his betrayal

24:35.140 --> 24:36.475
and killed your father.

24:37.809 --> 24:39.311
Those assholes can die.

24:50.780 --> 24:52.616
What about Do Gangjae?

24:53.283 --> 24:55.577
Don't we need to find Mujin?

24:55.660 --> 24:57.329
There is no evidence.

24:57.412 --> 24:59.039
That makes no sense.

24:59.831 --> 25:02.417
At least we can try to investigate.

25:02.501 --> 25:04.461
What are we going to do now?

25:06.505 --> 25:07.964
Yoon Donghoon…

25:14.012 --> 25:15.055
Come on in.

25:19.434 --> 25:20.435
Captain.

25:21.394 --> 25:22.729
Oh, hi.

25:24.564 --> 25:25.649
Do you want soju?

25:27.484 --> 25:28.568
It's all burnt.

25:30.529 --> 25:31.571
I won't…

25:33.365 --> 25:34.449
be able…

25:37.452 --> 25:40.038
to fall asleep if I'm sober tonight.

25:45.627 --> 25:46.753
Let me.

25:52.092 --> 25:53.218
Pildo.

25:54.427 --> 25:57.430
What would you do
if you found your sister's killer?

26:00.350 --> 26:02.477
Put him away.

26:03.061 --> 26:04.396
And if there's no evidence?

26:07.065 --> 26:08.567
You find him and there's no…

26:10.902 --> 26:12.279
No evidence.

26:28.587 --> 26:29.629
What if…

26:30.255 --> 26:31.965
you had the chance to kill the guy?

26:32.507 --> 26:34.593
No cameras, no witnesses.

26:34.676 --> 26:36.177
Nothing, but you!

26:39.014 --> 26:40.098
Then?

26:43.018 --> 26:46.354
Remember what you said
when I joined Narcotics?

26:50.900 --> 26:53.278
"Investigations are like sandcastles.

26:54.613 --> 26:56.197
You work hard to build it up,

26:56.740 --> 26:58.825
but the wave comes
and knocks it down constantly.

27:00.910 --> 27:04.914
But if you keep at it,
the low tide will come eventually.

27:07.167 --> 27:08.793
That's when you get your man."

27:15.508 --> 27:16.551
Choi Mujin.

27:18.094 --> 27:19.512
Won't be free long.

27:25.060 --> 27:26.102
That's not bad.

27:32.817 --> 27:34.194
I learned it from you.

27:42.035 --> 27:44.329
- Can I get a glass, please?
- Sure.

27:48.792 --> 27:49.834
Yes.

27:49.918 --> 27:50.835
Taeju.

27:51.878 --> 27:53.880
I don't think Jiwoo can finish the job.

27:56.675 --> 27:58.301
You get rid of Cha Giho.

28:04.683 --> 28:05.684
Yes, sir.

28:10.021 --> 28:13.024
YOON DONGHOON

29:01.489 --> 29:02.699
Just a minute.

29:04.659 --> 29:06.494
Wait, wait. Careful.

29:32.854 --> 29:36.024
SECURITY GUARD BREAK TIMES

29:38.568 --> 29:39.527
We're here.

29:39.611 --> 29:40.945
- You're going off?
- Yes.

29:41.029 --> 29:43.323
Careful. Careful.

29:43.406 --> 29:45.408
Your head.

29:46.034 --> 29:47.744
Get up. You're home.

29:47.827 --> 29:49.954
One, two, three.

29:50.789 --> 29:52.081
Where's your key?

29:52.707 --> 29:53.708
I have it.

29:54.209 --> 29:57.003
- Hey. Hey.
- I have it, so… so go.

30:00.465 --> 30:01.466
Go, Pildo.

30:01.549 --> 30:02.967
- Just open it.
- I'm okay.

30:03.051 --> 30:04.093
Just go.

30:04.719 --> 30:05.595
Shit.

30:05.678 --> 30:07.305
- You want me to stay?
- Ah.

30:15.730 --> 30:17.357
- Should I go?
- Yes, go.

30:18.733 --> 30:20.235
- Good night.
- Okay.

32:45.964 --> 32:47.340
Oh Hyejin.

32:47.423 --> 32:49.217
Choi Mujin's dog!

32:50.969 --> 32:52.929
Are you here to finish me?

32:55.974 --> 32:57.183
Drop the knife.

32:59.602 --> 33:01.604
Don't you see what's in my hand?

33:04.565 --> 33:06.109
Drop the knife.

33:08.653 --> 33:10.238
I came to ask you something.

33:12.365 --> 33:13.658
Ask something?

33:15.326 --> 33:17.662
You might die depending on the answer.

33:24.335 --> 33:26.337
My dad died because of you.

33:28.256 --> 33:30.758
But he never dropped his knife
until the moment he died.

33:30.842 --> 33:32.260
To protect me.

33:33.720 --> 33:36.597
I threw everything away
to catch this son of a bitch.

33:44.897 --> 33:47.817
Tell me what you did to my dad
five years ago today.

33:50.111 --> 33:51.070
Tell me!

34:01.330 --> 34:02.707
Are you Jiwoo?

34:06.085 --> 34:07.211
Yoon Jiwoo?

34:16.012 --> 34:17.847
You remember the name.

34:20.016 --> 34:21.017
Why?

34:22.560 --> 34:24.103
Were you feeling guilty, huh?

34:26.105 --> 34:27.565
Donghoon… No.

34:30.276 --> 34:32.403
Joonsu was undercover.

34:34.739 --> 34:36.240
He was our agent--

34:36.324 --> 34:37.450
I know that.

34:40.036 --> 34:42.413
I know that you sent him
into the organization.

34:42.997 --> 34:45.708
And my father betrayed you,
so you decided to take his life?

34:47.085 --> 34:48.252
Song Jiwoo…

34:50.588 --> 34:52.131
How did you…

34:54.509 --> 34:56.677
end up working for Choi Mujin?

35:01.724 --> 35:03.142
Choi Mujin…

35:04.143 --> 35:06.104
That demon and cunning!

35:20.868 --> 35:22.245
Captain!

35:23.663 --> 35:25.081
Captain!

35:25.164 --> 35:27.291
Captain!

35:28.042 --> 35:29.085
- Captain!
- Jiwoo.

35:30.378 --> 35:31.629
Captain!

35:32.713 --> 35:33.756
Jiwoo.

35:40.805 --> 35:41.973
Captain!

35:48.521 --> 35:50.398
Captain! Captain!

35:53.901 --> 35:54.777
Captain!

36:24.599 --> 36:25.808
Get out of here.

36:47.288 --> 36:49.916
JUNG TAEJU
SECOND-IN-COMMAND

36:52.835 --> 36:54.337
Taeju, you arrange them.

36:54.420 --> 36:55.338
Okay.

36:56.589 --> 36:57.840
You, step in.

36:57.924 --> 36:59.383
- Come on.
- Yes, sir.

36:59.884 --> 37:02.094
- You won last year too, right?
- That's right.

37:02.178 --> 37:03.554
Two years in a row.

37:03.638 --> 37:05.723
Next time let someone else win.

37:05.806 --> 37:06.682
- Yes, sir!
- Dongcheon!

37:06.766 --> 37:08.434
Dongcheon!

37:47.682 --> 37:48.516
Yeah.

37:49.058 --> 37:50.268
Take it easy, man.

37:54.272 --> 37:55.398
Enough.

37:55.481 --> 37:56.482
That's enough.

38:01.904 --> 38:02.905
What is this?

38:04.657 --> 38:05.783
A gift for you.

38:09.078 --> 38:09.954
"Gift for you."

38:10.037 --> 38:11.872
Isn't it great?

38:14.959 --> 38:15.960
Try it.

38:18.921 --> 38:20.548
Want me to die quickly?

38:20.631 --> 38:22.675
You punk.

38:22.758 --> 38:24.218
Don't use disposable lighters.

38:24.302 --> 38:25.553
You're the boss. Look the part.

38:25.636 --> 38:26.971
It doesn't make a sound.

38:27.680 --> 38:29.515
Yes, it does.

38:33.602 --> 38:35.229
What sound did you expect?

39:48.386 --> 39:49.887
CHOI MUJIN, YOON DONGHOON,
AND 5 OTHERS

39:49.970 --> 39:51.097
VISIT DRUG FACTORY ON NOVEMBER 6

40:08.155 --> 40:13.160
PLANS TO HAVE LUNCH WITH JANG INCHEOL,
DIRECTOR OF INCHANG IMMIGRATION OFFICE

40:15.079 --> 40:16.539
69TH INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:20.793 --> 40:22.211
364TH INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:22.294 --> 40:23.796
413RD INTELLIGENCE REPORT

40:30.761 --> 40:31.762
Joonsu…

40:31.846 --> 40:35.182
…was a cop until the day that he died.

40:37.476 --> 40:38.853
The proof is here.

40:41.730 --> 40:43.357
NOVEMBER 30, 2016

40:43.441 --> 40:46.777
Happy birthday,
my dear daughter.

40:46.861 --> 40:47.820
Taeju.

40:47.903 --> 40:48.946
Get out of here.

41:29.737 --> 41:31.071
PUREUNSOL MEMORIAL PARK
MAINTENANCE RECEIPT

41:31.155 --> 41:32.490
NAME OF BURIED: KIM JEONGA

41:32.573 --> 41:34.325
NEXT OF KIN: SONG JOONSU

41:34.408 --> 41:35.993
RECIPIENT: CHA GIHO

41:36.076 --> 41:37.077
Jiwoo.

41:38.329 --> 41:41.123
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME
PLEASE GIVE TO JIWOO

41:41.207 --> 41:42.583
Thank you…

41:46.045 --> 41:47.254
…for being alive.

41:49.089 --> 41:51.175
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS TO ME
PLEASE GIVE TO JIWOO

41:57.765 --> 42:00.267
TO MY BELOVED DAUGHTER JIWOO

42:31.549 --> 42:32.508
Jiwoo.

42:34.301 --> 42:36.470
My daughter who grew up too quickly.

42:37.972 --> 42:40.641
There were so many things
I wanted to do with you.

42:43.435 --> 42:45.187
Whenever there's hardship,

42:45.271 --> 42:47.940
I want to talk, beg,
and tell you to trust me.

42:48.899 --> 42:50.818
If you fall in love,

42:51.402 --> 42:53.862
I want to worry about what he's like.

42:55.656 --> 42:59.493
I wanna watch you get married
and have children.

43:00.786 --> 43:03.455
I want to share all
of those days with you,

43:05.207 --> 43:06.500
but there's a chance…

43:07.251 --> 43:11.130
that those days may never come.

43:16.093 --> 43:17.928
I was an inadequate dad,

43:18.887 --> 43:21.473
but I was happy because of you, Jiwoo.

43:22.391 --> 43:23.892
You have to be happy

43:25.060 --> 43:28.856
and live a good life
even if I'm not around, okay?

43:29.690 --> 43:31.775
I'm sorry I can't be with you.

43:34.612 --> 43:35.863
I love you.

43:40.284 --> 43:41.368
Your father…

43:43.078 --> 43:45.456
was my most trusted friend and brother.

43:47.666 --> 43:49.001
Do you have to…

43:49.084 --> 43:50.377
get revenge?

43:51.754 --> 43:53.505
Regardless of the price you pay?

43:53.589 --> 43:55.507
Here's the gun
that killed your dad.

43:57.301 --> 43:58.594
You're gonna find him.

43:59.178 --> 44:00.220
Kill him.

44:13.317 --> 44:15.402
Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

44:16.278 --> 44:17.988
I'm giving you my dagger.

44:18.072 --> 44:19.948
You kill him as soon as you can.

44:20.032 --> 44:21.533
Don't buy it.

44:23.202 --> 44:26.580
Chamomile tea.
It's supposed to help with insomnia.

44:35.047 --> 44:37.466
YOON DONGHOON

44:39.635 --> 44:41.553
Because you need conviction

44:42.513 --> 44:43.889
to be a killer.

46:40.839 --> 46:41.673
Captain…

46:42.591 --> 46:43.842
Hold on for me.
